"text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
"char_start": 5091,
"char_end": 5187,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 352.979,
"end": 357.172,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen it happen with equipment that uses RockShox components.",
"char_start": 5188,
"char_end": 5254,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 357.172,
"end": 361.874,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5255,
"char_end": 5329,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 361.874,
"end": 363.737,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What does a failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5342,
"char_end": 5377,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 363.737,
"end": 366.984,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
"char_start": 5378,
"char_end": 5439,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 366.984,
"end": 373.285,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too much of a slope.",
